---
title: Mojito
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, rum]
source: Classic cocktail, number 12 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

In a #highball glass{}, press @fresh mint{8%leaves} gently with @simple syrup{0.5%fl_oz} and @lime juice{0.75%fl_oz} — bruise the leaves, don't shred them. Add @white rum{2%fl_oz}, fill with crushed ice, and stir from the bottom to lift the mint. Top with @club soda{1%fl_oz} and garnish with a @fresh mint{1%sprig}.
